      "jcr:created": "Mon Aug 26 2024 14:38:59 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Right-sized</span></span> <span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">for MIS</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">You asked for it and now its here – the <span class=\"futura-bold\">37cm laparoscopic tip</span> for the Sonopet iQ Universal handpiece. Its our least invasive tip for general surgery applications – expanding the utility, maneuverability and performance of your ultrasonic tip portfolio. Combined with Sonopet iQ system’s simple set up and slender, low-friction sleeve, youll spend less time managing equipment and more time performing your best.<sup>6</sup></span></p>\n",
